{"ref":"BDB, זָקֵן","hw":"זָקֵן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָקֵן</span></big>  <strong>vb. be</strong> or <strong>become old (</strong>cf., according to Thes, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">ذَقُونٌ</span><em>a she-camal that lets her lower lip hang down,</em> 3, v. Lane <sup>968</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ذِقْنٌ</span> <em>decrepit man</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">Gn 18:12</a> + 14 times (often hard to disting. from pred. adj. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקֵן</span> q.v.); 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָֽקְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.22\">Pr 23:22</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקַנְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.5\">1 S 8:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקַ֫נְתָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:1\" href=\"/Joshua.13.1\">Jos 13:1</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקַנְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:2\" href=\"/Joshua.23.2\">Jos 23:2</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקַ֑נְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:13\" href=\"/Genesis.18.13\">Gn 18:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:2\" href=\"/Genesis.27.2\">27:2</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּזְקַן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.15\">2 Ch 24:15</a>;—<em>be</em> (or <em>become</em>) <em>old</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">Gn 18:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:13\" href=\"/Genesis.18.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:31\" href=\"/Genesis.19.31\">19:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:1\" href=\"/Genesis.27.1\">27:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:2\" href=\"/Genesis.27.2\">2</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.22\">1 S 2:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.18\">4:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.1\">8:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.2\">12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.12\">17:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:33\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.33\">2 S 19:33</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.1\">1 K 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.15\">15</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.14\">2 K 4:14</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:1\" href=\"/Genesis.24.1\">Gn 24:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בא בימים</span>), so <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:1\" href=\"/Joshua.13.1\">Jos 13:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:1\" href=\"/Joshua.23.1\">23:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 23:2\" href=\"/Joshua.23.2\">2</a> (‖ here <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאתִי בימים</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.1\">1 Ch 23:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבַע ימים</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.15\">2 Ch 24:15</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.22\">Pr 23:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:25\" href=\"/Psalms.37.25\">ψ 37:25</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">היה נער</span>); note especially <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקַנְתִּי מִהְיוֹת לאישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:12\" href=\"/Ruth.1.12\">Ru 1:12</a> <em>I am too old to belong to a man</em> (<em>husband</em>).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  only Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַזְקִין</span> inchoat. <em>shew age, grow old</em> = senescere Ew.§ <sup>122c</sup>, cf. Di; of youth <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.6\">Pr 22:6</a>; of tree-root <a data-ref=\"Job 14:8\" href=\"/Job.14.8\">Jb 14:8</a>.","next":"BDB, זָקֵן²","prev":"BDB, זָקָן"}